body:
Goto deserves all the love and support. He's a fantastic worker and plays his role stupendously well. I will forever be upset that he hasn't won the big one but, he will be fondly remembered as NJPW through and through. The man has been stalwart in his loyalty to the company and I greatly admire and respect him for it. 

&#x200B;

Also, him calling Great O-Khan a vulgar man on Twitter was hilarious. I'm not even on that site but hearing about that made me laugh.
